{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund \"Recycle-for-Cash\" machines at supermarkets",
        "additional_details": "If these machines are used there may be less littering because the public might rather have a bit of money than litter. This might also help with poverty. A bit of money can make a big difference.",
        "background": "Littering is a problem but setting up recycling machines where people can recycle for money could help to prevent this. I would like the government to set up the machines in supermarkets because this is where items are bought most.",
